{
 "_doc": "Ashfall env fx atlas v1 (env pass 1 r2, approved by Director). flame: 4-frame looping fire, 10 fps, anchor = bottom-centre, normal composite, draw over the burning prop at its fire_point. light: pre-rendered radial light, draw with ctx.globalCompositeOperation = \"lighter\" after units/buildings and before fog; anchor = centre; alpha = peak baked in, modulate with globalAlpha per flicker; ground lights are squashed to 0.8 in y for the 3/4 view. fog: dual-grid 32x32 fog edge tiles (cell = tile vertex, drawn at (vx*32-16, vy*32-16)); bits = FOGGED corner tiles TL=1 TR=2 BR=4 BL=8; bits 0 = draw nothing, bits 15 = fillRect (black, or rgba(0,0,0,0.45) for shroud). See HANDOFF-env.md.",
